{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11207730","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11207730","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120773001:1":{"text":"치크, 맹수연기가 원만하게 끝난 건 모두 네 덕분이다.","source_cn":"斗兽演祀能这么顺利地完成，真是多亏你了唷，奇克。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98C77BF119EFF5AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120773002:1":{"text":"석양의 신께서도 너의 용기와 기교를 보며, 기쁘게 잠드셨을 거다…","source_cn":"残阳神欣赏到这样卓绝的技艺和出色的勇气，也一定会欣慰长眠……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F685FCF13F4B2C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120773003:0":{"text":"사람들을 도울 수만 있다면, 그것만으로도 충분합니다.","source_cn":"只要能帮到大家，我做的一切就值得了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD87A0064CD26881C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120773004:1":{"text":"가족을 잃은 부족 사람들의 아픔은 치료되지 않겠지만, 너와 루마는 나쁜 일을 한 적도 없고, 우리 부족을 도와줬으니…","source_cn":"虽然失去至亲的伤痛难以痊愈，但你和卢玛之前没有迫害族人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB21FA41B721643E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120773005:1":{"text":"정말로 사막의 발톱을 떠나 안착할 곳을 찾는다면, 너희를 받아줄 부족이 분명히 있을 거다.","source_cn":"如果你们决心脱离流沙之爪，又没有想去的地方，我想，会有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4999272E9D6383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120773006:1":{"text":"비록 원한을 잊지 못하는 부족원이 있을 순 있겠지만, 그들에게 시간을 주며 너희의 진심을 보여준다면, 언젠가는 그들도 마음을 열 거라고 믿는다.","source_cn":"虽然可能还有一些族人比较顽固，但只要给他们一些时间，让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5541B2EC662B755","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120773007:0":{"text":"우와! 치크, 우리가 해냈어! 드디어 우릴 믿어주는 사람들이 생겼다고!","source_cn":"哇哦！太棒了，奇克！有人愿意相信我们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BC79A467FE61D69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120773008:0":{"text":"드디어… 고맙습니다, 족장님. 드디어… 흑흑!","source_cn":"终于……谢谢你，族长，我们终于做出了一些改变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2B933A7D3991991","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120773009:0":{"text":"그리고… 제안은 감사합니다. 루마와 함께 잘 생각해 볼게요.","source_cn":"也谢谢你的提议，我……我和卢玛，会考虑看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6358025187647E52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老族长库胡林":{"text":"족장 쿠훌린","source":"老族长库胡林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奇克":{"text":"치크","source":"奇克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢玛":{"text":"루마","source":"卢玛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"lo